{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45678","headline":"寒月送玄士入天台 · 贯休","name":"寒月送玄士入天台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"之子逍遥尘世薄，格淡於云语如鹤。\n相见唯谈海上山，碧侧青斜冷相沓。\n芒鞋竹杖寒冻时，玉霄忽去非有期。\n僮担赤笼密雪里，世人无人留得之。\n想入红霞路深邃，孤峰纵啸仙飙起。\n星精聚观泣海鬼，月涌薄烟花点水。\n送君丁宁有深旨，好寻佛窟游银地。\n雪眉衲僧皆正气，伊昔贞白先同此意。\n若得神圣之药，即莫忘远相寄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45678.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45678","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}